  "description": "Reffurence (RFR) was an annual Dutch furry convention for the BeNeLux region, organized by Stichting Reffurence. It celebrated the furry fandom through art, literature and performances based around anthropomorphic animals, and unlike most furry conventions it had no guests of honor, focusing on all attendees. The first was held August 3 to 6, 2023, in Antwerp, followed by Rotterdam in 2024 and Egmond aan Zee in 2025, and in 2025 it introduced an official companion app. The 2026 edition was postponed and in April 2026 the convention was discontinued.",
